From cf5641da0a7726231c3f2acad2954a86caf582c3 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Marin Varivoda <marinvarivoda@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 2 Oct 2026 17:05:48 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Add a cover search backend to CAHasFunctionOfDegreeAtMost

Al := "Cover" uses the places and expansions of "LinAlg", but only tests
the covers b*S + E + Q of the family C_b. In each cover it reads the pole
degrees of the functions in L(H) from the kernel of the transposed
vanishing matrix. Baseline sets b.
---
